     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PAR01                     TEXT('AGENT RATE FILE')
     A            ARCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            ARFND     R               REFFLD(FND)
     A            ARRT#     R               REFFLD(RT#)
     A            AREFDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('EFFECTIVE DATE')
